# ADDAF

This repository contains result files related to our paper "ADDAF: Authentication Scheme for Digital Twin-Based
Drone-Assisted Artificial Intelligence of Things with Federated Learning". Below is a description of each file in this project:

## File Descriptions

### A1.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the first scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A1-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the first scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A2.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the second scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A2-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the second scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A3.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the third scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A3-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the third scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A4.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the fourth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A4-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the fourth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A5.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the fifth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A5-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the fifth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A6.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the sixth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A6-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the sixth scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A7.rar

A compressed ".out" file that contains the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the last scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.

### A7-Energy Consumption.txt

A text file that contains energy readings extracted from the results of Omnet++ implementation (equipped with Inet) for the last scenario of the ADDAF Practicability section of the paper.
